    "CoiStatement": "The authors EM, AT, LT, TL, SW and NL are employed by SpeeDx PTY LTD and have shares and/or options in the company. AT & EM are inventors on the PlexZyme™ patent families WO 2007/041774 and WO 2007/041774 and AT, EM, SW, TL and LT are inventors on the PlexPrime™ patent family WO 2013/123552. Biocartis NV sell a range of Idylla Tests and Assays which contain PlexZyme™ and PlexPrime™ technology under license from SpeeDx Pty Ltd. These interests do not alter our adherence toPLOS ONE policies on sharing data and materials.",
